# Voice

- Plain, clean, modern, beautiful. UK English.
- Conversational, from Design Lab North’s side. Not agency-speak, not hype.
- Plural: Design Lab North **are**. Captions start from us: “Design Lab North are…”
- Pleasure of the work is a shape, not a requirement on every line. Choozlist: just the life registry. Swarm: excited to work on this hive brand. ModYu: the market-leading hair and scalp care brand. Proper sentences. No riddles.
- Never slight a live site or the people who built it. A rebuild sits with them, not over them. Do not pretend our plot is their current public site.
- Type is [Blender](https://binnenland.ch/typeface/blender#overview) (Book body, Medium kickers, Bold subheads, Strong titles). Grounds: Paper (#fff / #414141) and Ink (#000 / #fff) from the plates. Chamfered 45° language from the DLN mark.
- We are a design hub: brands and identities, marketing principles, redesigns, facelifts, new sites. Do not call that work “marks” on the public site. The DLN logo is still the mark in brand files.
- Footer legal is small. Greenhouse is the front.
- Do not list studio-owned shells on the greenhouse until Ewan says so.
